+The app contains no ROMs, BIOS files or copyrighted game assets. Dump your own
+games. US ROMs have the broadest KH Melon Mix enhancement support; EU and JP ROMs
+can have limited or game-specific support.
+
+## What Saltlord's Remix adds
+
+- An editable `KHDS: TOUCH REMIX` preset with separate defaults for cover-screen
+  portrait, cover-screen landscape, unfolded portrait and unfolded landscape.
+- Relative movement and camera touch zones, KH command controls, Attack, Jump,
+  Guard, X/Deck Command, Lock-On, Shortcut hold, Map/Navi, HUD and manual-hide
+  controls.
+- Context-sensitive touch controls with timed auto-hide and physical-controller-
+  aware visibility.
+- Per-control position, size and opacity editing, including optional grid snapping.
+- Per-game launch profiles: Automatic, Portrait 4:3, Landscape 4:3 and Landscape
+  Fullscreen/ultra-wide.
+- Adjustable portrait viewport positioning and foldable/tabletop-aware Automatic
+  behaviour.
+- HD cinematic playback with optional temporary landscape orientation, an
+  in-cinematic Rotate control and restoration of the gameplay orientation afterward.
+- One-time onboarding, an always-accessible Remix Guide, warmer Remix branding and
+  traceable build information.
+
+Existing user layouts are preserved during updates. New controls are migrated into
+the Remix preset without replacing existing component positions, scales or opacity.
+
+## Current limitations
+
+- Automatic posture/orientation changes can leave native 3D graphics stretched
+  until the game is restarted. Fixed launch profiles avoid mid-session rotation.
+- Automatic is the only profile that follows tabletop posture.
+- HD cinematics are not currently constrained to a foldable's tabletop upper panel.
+- HD cutscene replacement is available for 358/2 Days; upstream does not currently
+  provide an equivalent Re:Coded pack.
+
+The previously reported Re:Coded white screen was traced to a corrupted ROM dump
+and is not considered a Remix compatibility issue.
 
